    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        182.5825958251953,
        449.7366027832031,
        391.5716552734375,
        464.3705749511719
      ],
      "text": "300 Clofazimine 3-5",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        470.63311767578125,
        512.5032348632812,
        482.63311767578125
      ],
      "text": "a \t In children, doses of all drugs, including the fluoroquinolones, should be at the higher end of the recommended ranges",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21530151367188,
        480.2331237792969,
        512.4472045898438,
        492.2331237792969
      ],
      "text": "wherever possible,   ethambutol. Ethambutol should be dosed at 15 mg/kg, and not at 25 mg/kg as sometimes  except",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.21530151367188,
        489.8331298828125,
        390.3593444824219,
        501.8331298828125
      ],
      "text": "used in adults with DR-TB, as monitoring for optic neuritis is more difficult in children.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04730224609375,
        502.4331359863281,
        412.4793395996094,
        514.43310546875
      ],
      "text": "b \t DST could be unreliable – use an additional drug if DST is not done or result is susceptible.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04730224609375,
        515.0331420898438,
        512.4793090820312,
        527.0331420898438
      ],
      "text": "c \t Choose one drug in each of these groups; amikacin is preferred to kanamycin in children. Intramuscular injection of",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.22330474853516,
        524.6331176757812,
        322.8153381347656,
        536.6331176757812
      ],
      "text": "amikacin is very painful -intravenous infusion should be preferred.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04730224609375,
        537.2330932617188,
        343.1512756347656,
        549.2330932617188
      ],
      "text": "d \t Choose one or more of these drugs to make up total of four new drugs",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04730224609375,
        549.8331298828125,
        480.6793518066406,
        561.8331298828125
      ],
      "text": "e \t PAS (including PAS Na) is administered in acidic medium (e.g. yoghurt or orange juice) for improved absorption.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04730224609375,
        562.4331665039062,
        512.4795532226562,
        574.4331665039062
      ],
      "text": "f \t Consider use of these drugs if there are insufficient drugs in other groups to build an acceptable regimen. Each drug is",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.22330474853516,
        572.0331420898438,
        424.35931396484375,
        584.0331420898438
      ],
      "text": "considered as only half a drug - therefore two drugs in this group count as one additional drug.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04730224609375,
        584.6331176757812,
        321.3353576660156,
        596.6331176757812
      ],
      "text": "g \t In adults, high-dose isoniazid is defined as 16-20 mg/kg per day.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04730224609375,
        597.233154296875,
        512.4236450195312,
        609.233154296875
      ],
      "text": "h \t Linezolid dosage for TB is uncertain, but lower doses (300 mg twice daily or even 300 mg daily in adults) cause fewer",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        99.22330474853516,
        606.8331909179688,
        233.03134155273438,
        618.8331909179688
      ],
      "text": "adverse effects and still seem effective.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04730224609375,
        620.6331787109375,
        510.2394714355469,
        632.6331787109375
      ],
      "text": "i \t Thioacetazone should not be used in people living with HIV because of the serious risk of life-threatening adverse reaction.",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
